# NFL photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Bulky NFL yoke cut with shoulder nameplate, short sleeves with stripe bands, side helmet in frame. Solid `#000` (LED energy). No hanger on photo backs.

**Per-screen PNG + CSS.** NFL kits must read on **96×48**, **64×48**, and **64×32** Xibo boards. Photo assets and `display.css` both account for format — do not use one `background-size` for all LEDs.

**Wordmark:** baked into the PNG only (club name on the yoke plate, never the patron name or number). Upright block caps heat-transfer on the yoke — not italic, not arched like soccer. Letter color = kit secondary. CSS must **not** reprint the team name on photo kits (`.soccer-jersey-team` hidden when `usePhotoBack`).

**Collar (PNG):** Leave **≥12% empty black** above the collar ribbing in the asset so the neckline is never flush with the image top. Full gold collar band must be obvious in the file before Pages.

**Helmet (PNG):** gold (or kit secondary) helmet on the **right**, overlapping the jersey hem. Helmet facemask bottom **≥22% above** the image bottom edge — not tucked into the corner.

**Patron name overlay:** CSS only (`#displayMain.soccer-jersey-name`). Upright Impact / condensed caps. Halfway between yoke wordmark bottom and number box top. Name `top` ~18% (96×48 / 64×48 ~17%, 64×32 ~16%); `height` ~9%; cap ~11.5vh.

**Number overlay:** CSS only (`#displaySub.soccer-jersey-number`). `top` ~40% (96×48 ~39%, 64×32 ~38%); `height` ~28%; `align-content: center`; cap ~48vh.

**Background layer (`display.css`) — height-fit, per format:**

| Format | `background-size` | `background-position` |
|---|---|---|
| default | `auto 86%` | `center 50%` |
| 96×48 | `auto 90%` | `center 50%` |
| 64×48 | `auto 88%` | `center 50%` |
| 64×32 | `auto 82%` | `center 50%` |

Height-fit keeps collar + helmet inside wide short boards. QA ScammerVille on **64×32** before shipping other NFL kits.

